def helpRoot(): String =
  """Scuzz Lang CLI

Usage: scuzz [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  build    Compile a Scuzz Lang project to a native executable (LLVM)
  run      Build and run a Scuzz Lang project
  watch    Watch sources and rebuild on change (compile loop, not hot reload)
  test     Run tests: Headless structural goldens for [ui] packages; IO smoke (TESTRT exit 0) otherwise
  check    Format-verify src/ + parse + typecheck (the linter; no codegen / link). JSON with --message-format=json
  lsp      Language server wrapping `scuzz check` JSON diagnostics (stdin/stdout LSP)
  fmt      Format Scuzz Lang sources under src/
  fuzz     Search in-source properties, drivers, and [taps] events under TestRuntime; mix coverage-guided search and mutation
  new      Create a new Scuzz Lang project
  ide      Launch the bundled Scuzz IDE (`[ui]` package in the SDK)
  package  Package a project for host, Android, or iOS
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --message-format <MESSAGE_FORMAT>
          Diagnostic format: human (default) or json (`scuzz check` only) [default: human] [possible values: human, json]
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  scuzz new myapp --ui
  scuzz check
  scuzz check --message-format=json
  scuzz lsp
  scuzz ide
  scuzz ide --headless .
  scuzz test
  scuzz run --headless
  scuzz run examples/studio
  scuzz run --headless --script examples/studio/build/record.script --dump examples/studio/build/debug.dump examples/studio
  scuzz watch
  scuzz run --watch --headless
  scuzz fuzz --iterations 16

JSON diagnostics are the check protocol. `scuzz lsp` wraps `scuzz check` (open buffers overlay disk; not a second typer).
`scuzz check` is the linter. `watch` rebuilds. `[ui] run --watch` is hot reload: it keeps the process, recompiles build/reload.dylib, and stamp-reloads the View tree (Signals stay). IO-only `run --watch` kills and reruns on source change. Live dump: build/debug.dump (includes [heap] kinds, delta, and [live] rows). Live inject: build/inject.script (tap/xy/text/type/key/compose/commit/caret/select/copy/cut/paste/drag/hover/secondary/pump/scroll/backspace/dump/reload/quit/resetpeak). Desktop quit is window close. Headless `quit` stops the session. Desktop/Mobile record: build/record.script (live keys write `key`; auto-repeat writes `key a+repeat`; Shift+arrows write `key ArrowLeft+shift`; copy/cut/paste write those verbs; hover and right-click write `hover` / `secondary`).
"""

def helpFmt(): String =
  """Format Scuzz Lang sources under src/

Usage: scuzz fmt [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  [default: .]

Options:
      --check
          Check only (nonzero exit if files need reformat)
      --message-format <MESSAGE_FORMAT>
          Diagnostic format: human (default) or json (`scuzz check` only) [default: human] [possible values: human, json]
  -h, --help
          Print help

Examples:
  scuzz fmt
  scuzz fmt --check
  scuzz fmt examples/hello
"""

